er.poepping@tobit.com","name":"Heiner Pöpping"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T08:43:41Z","email":"heiner.poepping@tobit.com","name":"Heiner Pöpping"},"message":":recycle: Refactor history layer context provider\n\nThis change inverts the logic for controlling the history layer. The `isHistoryDisabled` prop is replaced by `isHistoryEnabled` across `ChaynsProvider`, `ChaynsHost`, and related components.\n\nThe new `isHistoryEnabled` prop defaults to `false`, making history layer enablement opt-in. This enhances safety and predictability, especially for federated modules, by requiring explicit activation of the history layer.\n\nAdditionally, the `ChaynsHistoryLayerProvider` now supports a `null` layer, allowing it to be rendered unconditionally while still controlling history registration on the static layer stack.","tree":{"sha":"2d8d8e7d11eebb49c65ff86b0e6c5cea4397b2c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TobitSoftware/chayns-api/git/trees/2d8d8e7d11eebb49c65ff86b0e6c5cea4397b2c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TobitSoftware/chayns-api/git/commits/614aa7a43c088ee9007876c27b07956ec87fe55b","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d8d8e7d11eebb49c65ff86b0e6c5cea4397b2c4\nparent b720b3ce1618e9a3f048ccd7d2098e3921c9b5ef\nauthor Heiner Pöpping <heiner.poepping@tobit.com> 1784018621 +0200\ncommitter Heiner Pöpping <heiner.poepping@tobit.com> 1784018621 +0200\n\n:recycle: Refactor history layer context provider\n\nThis change inverts the logic for controlling the history layer. The `isHistoryDisabled` prop is replaced by `isHistoryEnabled` across `ChaynsProvider`, `ChaynsHost`, and related components.\n\nThe new `isHistoryEnabled` prop defaults to `false`, making history layer enablement opt-in. This enhances safety and predictability, especially for federated modules, by requiring explicit activation of the history layer.\n\nAdditionally, the `ChaynsHistoryLayerProvider` now supports a `null` layer, allowing it to be rendered unconditionally while still controlling history registration on the static layer stack.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg8uwYs+FyOVXNwBIcA5WY4ZdMEG\n4K5CbpkxcbOtnu1wsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNCjKOe1GcXiZRiVYGfxr9QUPG5kj2S6yprG38gqq4K+4K0x+KCJT2yTmlO90z3hrN\nXeL1Ispv7IyU5MMo2cXgY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T20:50:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57671468?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpoepping/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpoepping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpoepping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpoepping/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hpoepping","id":57671468,"login":"hpoepping","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjcxNDY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpoepping/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpoepping/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpoepping/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpoepping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpoepping/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpoepping","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TobitSoftware/chayns-api/commit/614aa7a43c088ee9007876c27b07956ec87fe55b","node_id":"C_kwDOIdX8QtoAKDYxNGFhN2E0M2MwODhlZTkwMDc4NzZjMjdiMDc5NTZlYzg3ZmU1NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TobitSoftware/chayns-api/commit/b720b3ce1618e9a3f048ccd7d2098e3921c9b5ef","sha":"b720b3ce1618e9a3f048ccd7d2098e3921c9b5ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TobitSoftware/chayns-api/commits/b720b3ce1618e9a3f048ccd7d2098e3921c9b5ef"}],"sha":"614aa7a43c088ee9007876c27b07956ec87fe55b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TobitSoftware/chayns-api/commits/614aa7a43c