tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/commits/3db18f8cdac05b6fdde4e0119ba3ead0cae31006/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T19:11:49Z","email":"francois.baldi@igbx.fr","name":"gloubix"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T19:11:49Z","email":"francois.baldi@igbx.fr","name":"gloubix"},"message":"fix(plugins): read import.meta.env.DEV directly instead of stale state\n\n`PluginLoader` stored dev mode in state and set it inside the mount effect\n(`setDev(import.meta.env.DEV)`), then read the still-`false` `dev` in the same\neffect — so in dev mode it needlessly called `js_plugins_path` (a disk scan) on\nthe first pass before the state flush switched the render branch.\n\n`import.meta.env.DEV` is a Vite compile-time constant; read it directly as a\nmodule-level `isDev`. Drops the redundant state and the extra render.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb3850885cb2db857cbc1a4df781b8c73729bb06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/git/trees/fb3850885cb2db857cbc1a4df781b8c73729bb06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/git/commits/3db18f8cdac05b6fdde4e0119ba3ead0cae31006","verification":{"payload":"tree fb3850885cb2db857cbc1a4df781b8c73729bb06\nparent e401d8b4be11c2bb41fa32150634b550aaa23723\nauthor gloubix <francois.baldi@igbx.fr> 1783019509 +0200\ncommitter gloubix <francois.baldi@igbx.fr> 1783019509 +0200\n\nfix(plugins): read import.meta.env.DEV directly instead of stale state\n\n`PluginLoader` stored dev mode in state and set it inside the mount effect\n(`setDev(import.meta.env.DEV)`), then read the still-`false` `dev` in the same\neffect — so in dev mode it needlessly called `js_plugins_path` (a disk scan) on\nthe first pass before the state flush switched the render branch.\n\n`import.meta.env.DEV` is a Vite compile-time constant; read it directly as a\nmodule-level `isDev`. Drops the redundant state and the extra render.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEZ1Y6THXvniR7EA96YBank9INgXgFAmpGt/YbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMiwxAAoJEGAWp5PSDYF43HwP/RsymoKe9CH6niN27viT\nYXzDhoRfnxtj/KjFxuhy/Q7UtuqnF4AeyjbHbcQw2XM7Pybwfde8byCfpkWN4woN\nZtjJwvksh0tbY3LIEomZmIeMTPMh3ShLawrrS5B49jDmEP2gvDXx5JuiLi5ylXur\ntZSaX12InqZ/aDz5waamBDB5/Aqgk5x0fW0kNDSYUhcpHz7qaLI8Meu7Du3JR20c\n/8Oa9jOdDh+pyHW9lEG4yje0yOZWM9oxgmToyWSHdfefsLYlqOkIEOHzqp/VYY0R\n6y9oRWsH/82Jq99JTODjpTLfhPWsyuwcuofiZunYwcy+EDmkXiQs3p8QZR5HbW3I\nhm2z84Pjfs3/z11CcgAF2lmYqrbCglZI3ir3/nwTad5Q+NjZcy9f7wjN9ixN0o2R\nREeQbh+Sa7JaH5WXYy/l9W3ZnAKIdUUFUVBBtsETCUrnyXT1GrLrbzm9RAnC1AZK\nuyDnuQ5/j3PBftzZqRZo56ildvp7SW+wVMxGoyE/qvuyHDi3Xj8JVaMXXcwt+nvV\n1TI8o5XbNLw1iOlHIsi0bLKq7KPjcY3Opl7RGcRR+l+/j+EMyn47dvhWyGPxLaXM\nChfC9JS/ELc0J8HpASDOHg1Q7N2Vg9nU9BzWrxf9Uh7HNVXO5sDv7H1UUVIuhMtc\nIy90J2hN7YkUTlYc1JegcVi1\n=UkUf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-02T19:12:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1148460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gloubix","id":1148460,"login":"gloubix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDg0NjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/subscriptions","type":