ec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/commits/207c213e15fb34323ab10a72ad29b569b88d0ec6"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ludea/Sparus/commit/376a072279940406f180525d492cc34a8171ddd8","sha":"376a072279940406f180525d492cc34a8171ddd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/commits/376a072279940406f180525d492cc34a8171ddd8"}],"sha":"d4b61227d167e4492e3d839f397c0b1c0aa11b2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/commits/d4b61227d167e4492e3d839f397c0b1c0aa11b2d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1148460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gloubix","id":1148460,"login":"gloubix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDg0NjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/commits/aa6e083c581c2969d49b4a295ab5303f1c0d8610/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:41:40Z","email":"francois.baldi@igbx.fr","name":"gloubix"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:41:40Z","email":"francois.baldi@igbx.fr","name":"gloubix"},"message":"feat(plugins): render registered plugin slots + add an options target (#1034)\n\nThe plugin context exposed header/body/footer arrays via `register()`, but\nnothing ever rendered them, so plugin elements were invisible and there was no\nway to target the options page.\n\n- usePlugins.tsx: add an `options` position and export a `<PluginSlot position>`\n  component that renders every element registered for that slot (and nothing\n  when empty, so it is a safe drop-in).\n- Mount `<PluginSlot>` in the header (Header.tsx), the body (Index.tsx) and the\n  options page (Options.tsx).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0910302bc782432b21b933cb9ce09e685563faa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/git/trees/0910302bc782432b21b933cb9ce09e685563faa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/git/commits/aa6e083c581c2969d49b4a295ab5303f1c0d8610","verification":{"payload":"tree 0910302bc782432b21b933cb9ce09e685563faa2\nparent 207c213e15fb34323ab10a72ad29b569b88d0ec6\nauthor gloubix <francois.baldi@igbx.fr> 1782657700 +0200\ncommitter gloubix <francois.baldi@igbx.fr> 1782657700 +0200\n\nfeat(plugins): render registered plugin slots + add an options target (#1034)\n\nThe plugin context exposed header/body/footer arrays via `register()`, but\nnothing ever rendered them, so plugin elements were invisible and there was no\nway to target the options page.\n\n- usePlugins.tsx: add an `options` position and export a `<PluginSlot position>`\n  component that renders every element registered for that slot (and nothing\n  when empty, so it is a safe drop-in).\n- Mount `<PluginSlot>` in the header (Header.tsx), the body (Index.tsx) and the\n  options page (Options.tsx).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEZ1Y6THXvniR7EA96YBank9INgXgFAmpBMqQbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMiwxAAoJEGAWp5PSDYF4F9IP/0gj6IbItI/RniWF9FXo\nE0LL7kYu80N2jyHowqaaMBec6GW2oJwcoPOqBhY8AnUlyUzMDBCOkLaHV0RiGGJu\n8fDPNNFS5oXuK0GJeBRx5C78uO7+4uyOWn7Vw86NYSQv/1pxASCtqR6pt3HzIrPf\nkjNgnhbTS6Pm2B/bhHUFzZUwnqiG4mkFMz6bC1EjVj6APamr21wqZMh9fQD3hPU5\n807+YY1y82R90Nb6gev8KHwl83erCIv9MXIcc5Iolx