mits/aa6e083c581c2969d49b4a295ab5303f1c0d8610"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1148460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gloubix","id":1148460,"login":"gloubix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDg0NjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/commits/fea9a0141606e150b7f9f57a3efff93bd9100624/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:38:45Z","email":"francois.baldi@igbx.fr","name":"gloubix"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:38:45Z","email":"francois.baldi@igbx.fr","name":"gloubix"},"message":"fix(plugins): resolve entry before registering remote + cache-bust bundle (#1037)\n\nIn production the remote `entry` was assigned inside an async `.then()` while\n`registerRemotes`/`loadRemote` ran synchronously right after, so the remote was\nregistered with an empty entry and the plugin never loaded (dev worked only\nbecause the URL was set synchronously).\n\nResolve the on-disk bundle path first, then register and load. Also append a\n`?v=<timestamp>` cache-buster (with `force` re-registration) so an updated\nfrontend.js is fetched fresh instead of served stale from the webview cache —\nwhich is why updated plugins only appeared \"after a few hours\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2716e4680a4eb96a4df1a55a072eebd065d174f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/git/trees/2716e4680a4eb96a4df1a55a072eebd065d174f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/git/commits/fea9a0141606e150b7f9f57a3efff93bd9100624","verification":{"payload":"tree 2716e4680a4eb96a4df1a55a072eebd065d174f1\nparent 207c213e15fb34323ab10a72ad29b569b88d0ec6\nauthor gloubix <francois.baldi@igbx.fr> 1782657525 +0200\ncommitter gloubix <francois.baldi@igbx.fr> 1782657525 +0200\n\nfix(plugins): resolve entry before registering remote + cache-bust bundle (#1037)\n\nIn production the remote `entry` was assigned inside an async `.then()` while\n`registerRemotes`/`loadRemote` ran synchronously right after, so the remote was\nregistered with an empty entry and the plugin never loaded (dev worked only\nbecause the URL was set synchronously).\n\nResolve the on-disk bundle path first, then register and load. Also append a\n`?v=<timestamp>` cache-buster (with `force` re-registration) so an updated\nfrontend.js is fetched fresh instead of served stale from the webview cache —\nwhich is why updated plugins only appeared \"after a few hours\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEZ1Y6THXvniR7EA96YBank9INgXgFAmpBMfUbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMiwxAAoJEGAWp5PSDYF4jcQQAI41tGXrlZy0C3wrZmYj\nV1EKQQzX6LmX7YaB6q5MBfVYcVRj7RMqpYjiGbWuH2sv2Q8J+yXf8PK7yCyeLn3G\n1EZDp4axrsfSETAuYjuE1l2BFqDWVUfqy+TmeWqBMlCZ962HN8Fp5X9kqcBe7Mln\ngxWXB/oP48wVC3Ae+yeRqKF+uxqWae39QAEAm9+IzUdOM3CkHJ+5iIYgg7KmjrMo\nFxU+hA+rmAsBUjadI8W5XnreRYkGka+nuJibSP/8Enz1be/G6+CgbJXaKd7cHxEI\ntjEKoyUyQ3FRMv7Nbw6kfyNtK+yM9MiHYRu+ZqR7RIkYbm6nJO61ZnapKofY64g4\nmTWmLQKAG049wayFcF+dvxnOane7drmFyb3dZ4ibLexlUb8Xx+hGTz/DKcmXyH2U\nS4HZD5B8D3o+6J50Y0wFYdggG0Y0vdiy5xnym8f4g8X+CkfaKx0+WuLsLi6sdYG9\nyrbhqZjEYtWIo+jSnJ5k0kf9Odujo4n9cbBvD23x8/4HGqiNmoB6DP2bOhSvijDS\nl6