ithub.com/users/gloubix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gloubix","id":1148460,"login":"gloubix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDg0NjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/commits/d1cb98de5242a9f352a3153d5182cb81d64ea011/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:34:05Z","email":"francois.baldi@igbx.fr","name":"gloubix"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:34:05Z","email":"francois.baldi@igbx.fr","name":"gloubix"},"message":"fix(ci): don''t sign Android build on fork PRs (#1033)\n\nThe \"setup Android signing\" step ran on every `pull_request`, but fork PRs\nget empty secrets, so it wrote an empty keystore and the Gradle release\nsigning then failed (KeytoolException / null `as String` cast), breaking the\nAndroid job on every external PR.\n\n- build.yml: expose `ANDROID_KEY_BASE64` as a job env and only run the signing\n  step when it is non-empty, so pushes/internal PRs still sign while fork PRs\n  skip it.\n- build.gradle.kts: only attach the release `signingConfig` when\n  `keystore.properties` exists, so an unsigned release build no longer crashes\n  on a null cast.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1362efb44b1ac1b819ce23c24e416378cb372f05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/git/trees/1362efb44b1ac1b819ce23c24e416378cb372f05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/git/commits/d1cb98de5242a9f352a3153d5182cb81d64ea011","verification":{"payload":"tree 1362efb44b1ac1b819ce23c24e416378cb372f05\nparent 207c213e15fb34323ab10a72ad29b569b88d0ec6\nauthor gloubix <francois.baldi@igbx.fr> 1782657245 +0200\ncommitter gloubix <francois.baldi@igbx.fr> 1782657245 +0200\n\nfix(ci): don''t sign Android build on fork PRs (#1033)\n\nThe \"setup Android signing\" step ran on every `pull_request`, but fork PRs\nget empty secrets, so it wrote an empty keystore and the Gradle release\nsigning then failed (KeytoolException / null `as String` cast), breaking the\nAndroid job on every external PR.\n\n- build.yml: expose `ANDROID_KEY_BASE64` as a job env and only run the signing\n  step when it is non-empty, so pushes/internal PRs still sign while fork PRs\n  skip it.\n- build.gradle.kts: only attach the release `signingConfig` when\n  `keystore.properties` exists, so an unsigned release build no longer crashes\n  on a null cast.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEZ1Y6THXvniR7EA96YBank9INgXgFAmpBMN0bFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMiwxAAoJEGAWp5PSDYF4S+MQAKfESQS73/DMJK457fMU\nZy1znUXLF0s+NNveorg9XrgZa6P88JZzIrJPbmEWqJtAhu33eVgw3b7RBWsTOBSi\nV/r7XOgHhtF/y5N0QVIaL+IQdbSekqAaURGD4b6eygXD348Cx36w1fmxjwKalkVe\nFIlM0FRiBRa4SsqfBCc9dUNiIRFH5tZgYxgkLjzFTPiqF+s09qf5iG5O++HeH25n\nzv/ZIzFbNqXYROhA17d5DcMNYWiy8XhYvFFxlnomVidZbVmeRZnTAoe6D7MzTvXe\nXatWiTtjtINb1bt1eMAD/RBQCoDJf8EL9INLUDDU+wOnusT+IzdVzZ24pMTng76W\nJBOccETAqwFPdIQ7z4UzR+VW0ITXKry6v5SmTlHTYgW0Z86rPgEw3BmyCs+g4vy7\nr+3h+rXfRLMCwxWDBP8muyYb35x3KES1eLr5vifuHJCXy2Z23c2Jm3UgZeDeRP7v\nM62Q/cg8+u7Z+jtuhtE5ar2trbmelLTdRY+7jPSUZ+QuoawC+5Pf0z+sTKqH6zsE\nkynArE5qrLDA3uCnquPKvO5fijXTfdT2pOv5uOeWJE5SfDXo0R9ap/gAK9fYajkC\nn68+rkaiaMTih0sltBov5Llue6rD0+NvY/IdkQ5Sj0MWeBfkKQ8qDn9AQMZXBlJZ\nQs/2yJhYN8epP0dHbF4z7k5z\n=hFLE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-28T14:41:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser