"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/commits/376a072279940406f180525d492cc34a8171ddd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:32:49Z","email":"francois.baldi@igbx.fr","name":"gloubix"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:32:49Z","email":"francois.baldi@igbx.fr","name":"gloubix"},"message":"fix(ui): reset body margin and prevent window overflow (#1035, #1036)\n\nThe app shipped no CSS reset, so the browser default `body { margin: 8px }`\napplied. In the fixed 800x600 decorationless window that 8px margin (a) showed\nthe page background as a white border (#1036) and (b) pushed the 800x600 Grid\n~16px past the window edge, producing scrollbars (#1035, the reported ~20px).\n\nMount MUI''s `CssBaseline` and a small `GlobalStyles` that zeroes\nmargin/padding and pins `html, body, #root` to 100% height with\n`overflow: hidden`, so the launcher fills the window with no border or\nscrollbar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02c9cd879aafbb86e7dab45a2e40bc873051035b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/git/trees/02c9cd879aafbb86e7dab45a2e40bc873051035b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludea/Sparus/git/commits/376a072279940406f180525d492cc34a8171ddd8","verification":{"payload":"tree 02c9cd879aafbb86e7dab45a2e40bc873051035b\nparent 207c213e15fb34323ab10a72ad29b569b88d0ec6\nauthor gloubix <francois.baldi@igbx.fr> 1782657169 +0200\ncommitter gloubix <francois.baldi@igbx.fr> 1782657169 +0200\n\nfix(ui): reset body margin and prevent window overflow (#1035, #1036)\n\nThe app shipped no CSS reset, so the browser default `body { margin: 8px }`\napplied. In the fixed 800x600 decorationless window that 8px margin (a) showed\nthe page background as a white border (#1036) and (b) pushed the 800x600 Grid\n~16px past the window edge, producing scrollbars (#1035, the reported ~20px).\n\nMount MUI''s `CssBaseline` and a small `GlobalStyles` that zeroes\nmargin/padding and pins `html, body, #root` to 100% height with\n`overflow: hidden`, so the launcher fills the window with no border or\nscrollbar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEZ1Y6THXvniR7EA96YBank9INgXgFAmpBMJYbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMiwxAAoJEGAWp5PSDYF44K0P/02n6oTY3iO2djnp0Fa1\nUBe1i2cboSqSeDri31d85Dkn8RUNYa+Rrtex6QuJ26lE8ZwB6VhxUC5V+fK2lFhZ\nOR1aw3cEN3m43wn0VTMcWSl2bcYgLDMJvRr2KBoWqSp8uajCnK6UTn9Zgq186+L2\nd+eeIgY0DhnZZz5fUU3czS6ZgHJXv6J02ULc9JyXIzLsJ1+zFbx+kpCGxFpBSz1i\nIJNbunMEFnfOZNlHFQAMEN2s4LEIiefetq5PIKY79o+bP2Leu7h9PUReJQnbsAqc\nkZbSc1Djs8QYRywTFVLUit1OSMcKtn0umiUEJ05FK9DDymPqADVDBq0T+LED/Sj4\nEJBaXLsk6Zkyzz/sa3y7yBdJvaPMiFluQtMd4KH810vWtwaSRpJWCaCp7yaSFeG0\nsTS27hO9ZAr9iWh2yHEC7yRsjV/YTbtF7WmZ+AZwCZxH9ZTrp7xp8aKkSbUmF5CZ\nE8SUQvribvianwDNdVGl7DwDZcVdBeicLr0Wj4V+3iDrQJGzqkNFVP6uS4Zej9Nu\nE5x6bqHPVIvHbx3zYoJNAECFDMeAlU9JKaYmoTF/UwD358/GS6wmOoKXeTXIFeAf\nFK8oTNw2kqratQWNCFl/EpR5zALl9tFsMnGm4Yw8AsDE1Fq618ptlMHHFOK+bJdR\nfpgutpSIZRNEY17Xb6eQMTsP\n=2xgH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-28T14:41:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1148460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gloubix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gloubix","id":1148460,"login":"gloubix","node_id":"MDQ