hor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2528600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlariCode","id":2528600,"login":"AlariCode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjg2MDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PurpleSchool/knowledge-base/commits/7bd9eb2579756f3cdd4ecfa2857cf36c076b4d84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:37:25Z","email":"antonlarichev@gmail.com","name":"Alaricode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:37:25Z","email":"antonlarichev@gmail.com","name":"Alaricode"},"message":"fix: исправить фактические ошибки в статьях по Nuxt\n\nПо итогам ревью статей учеником:\n\n- useNuxtData описывался несуществующим API (принимает загрузчик,\n  возвращает pending/error/refresh). Статья переписана под реальный\n  API: чтение payload по ключу, связка с useFetch/useAsyncData,\n  оптимистичные обновления, refreshNuxtData и clearNuxtData;\n- проверка индикатора загрузки сразу после await никогда не сработает —\n  статусы перенесены в шаблон, добавлено пояснение и вариант с lazy;\n- клиентская загрузка через onMounted + $fetch заменена на\n  useFetch с server: false;\n- убран await у useFetch с lazy: true;\n- «в Nuxt 3 индикатор загрузки не встроен» и несуществующий пакет\n  @nuxt/loading-indicator заменены на встроенный NuxtLoadingIndicator\n  и composable useLoadingIndicator;\n- npm run start не запускает production в Nuxt 3 и 4 — в восьми местах\n  заменено на node .output/server/index.mjs и npm run preview,\n  блок для Nuxt 2 помечен явно;\n- убрана избыточная типизация ref<number>(0), исправлена аннотация\n  setup(props: MyProps), ломавшая вывод типов;\n- добавлены разделы про defineProps/defineEmits, withDefaults и\n  альтернативный синтаксис defineComponent;\n- у примеров проставлена версия Nuxt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d99b036a9fdd37bf1805de01aaf0600e68b99cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PurpleSchool/knowledge-base/git/trees/6d99b036a9fdd37bf1805de01aaf0600e68b99cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PurpleSchool/knowledge-base/git/commits/7bd9eb2579756f3cdd4ecfa2857cf36c076b4d84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2528600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlariCode","id":2528600,"login":"AlariCode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjg2MDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PurpleSchool/knowledge-base/commit/7bd9eb2579756f3cdd4ecfa2857cf36c076b4d84","node_id":"C_kwDOIf1SYNoAKDdiZDllYjI1Nzk3NTZmM2NkZDRlY2ZhMjg1N2NmMzZjMDc2YjRkODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PurpleSchool/knowledge-base/commit/53208147873ef865fa21054c9acff4814b4b4545","sha":"53208147873ef865fa21054c9acff4814b4b4545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PurpleSchool/knowledge-base/commits/53208147873ef865fa21054c9acff4814b4b4545"}],"sha":"7bd9eb2579756f3cdd4ecfa2857cf36c076b4d84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PurpleSchool/knowledge-base/commits/7bd9eb2579756f3cdd4ecfa2857cf36c076b4d84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2528600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlariCode","id":2528600,"login":"AlariCode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjg2MDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PurpleSchool/knowledge-base/commits/53208147873ef865fa21054c9acff4814b4b4545/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:37:15Z","email":"antonlarichev@gmail.com","name":"Alaricode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:37:15Z","email":"antonlarichev@gmail.com","name":"Alaricode"},"message":"fix: убрать дублирующиеся H1 и восстановить разметку кода\n\nСтраница статьи сама рендерит <h1> из frontmatter, поэтому заголовок\nв теле давал второй H1:\n\n- 58 статей — удалён заголовок-дубль в начале тела;\n- 7 статей (TypeScript, javascript/functions/function) — H1 были\n  настоящими разделами, иерархия сдвинута на уровень вниз.\n\nВ части статей H1 оказались симптомом потерянных ограждений код-блоков:\nbash-комментарии рендерились заголовками, а код — обычным текстом.\nВосстановлены открывающие ``` в kak-ustanovit-python (10 блоков) и\ngit/configuration/list. В git/{specialized/alias,tools/tree,undoing/checkout}\nи fsd/structure/re-export ограждений не было вовсе — код размечен\nцеликом (56, 49, 60 и 63 блока соответственно).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60ce575374c8cc46340c92cee6f2e2af9c042898","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PurpleSchool/knowledge-base/git/trees/60ce575374c8cc46340c92cee6f2e2af9c042898"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PurpleSchool/knowledge-base/git/commits/53208147873ef865fa21054c9acff4814b4b4545","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2528600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlariCode","id":2528600,"login":"AlariCode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjg2MDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlariCode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h