essage":"Redesign README stat cards with light/dark variants and embedded fonts\n\n- Warm editorial palette (paper/vermilion) with a dark counterpart; README\n  uses <picture> so GitHub serves the variant matching the viewer''s theme\n- Fraunces + Instrument Sans subsets inlined as data URIs (GitHub''s image\n  sandbox blocks external fonts)\n- Contributions card: drop PR opened/reviewed (the Actions token cannot see\n  them), add per-active-day figure, render years as columns with the\n  in-progress year hatched\n- Languages card: composition strip plus per-language tiles, palette\n  validated for colour-vision deficiency and contrast in both modes\n- Split rendering into scripts/cards.mjs; add scripts/render-cards.mjs\n  (npm run cards) to iterate on the design from cached data\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"534e259e806480a074876c30478f876c61453462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smgsankar/smgsankar/git/trees/534e259e806480a074876c30478f876c61453462"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smgsankar/smgsankar/git/commits/e76c40c30fd261045c0393064ce6e6ab2fa73cb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51292478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smgsankar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smgsankar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smgsankar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smgsankar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smgsankar","id":51292478,"login":"smgsankar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjkyNDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smgsankar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smgsankar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smgsankar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smgsa