155dc1db9c8511562827a39f899de47eaccbd","sha":"7bc155dc1db9c8511562827a39f899de47eaccbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/commits/7bc155dc1db9c8511562827a39f899de47eaccbd"}],"sha":"3b2faa44a4923009807125cd639790661d6f9b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/commits/3b2faa44a4923009807125cd639790661d6f9b63"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/commits/7bc155dc1db9c8511562827a39f899de47eaccbd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:29:41Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:29:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a bulkCreateUsers namespace container (#13)\n\nMove the root Query (bulkCreateUsersMaxUploadSize) + root Mutation (bulkCreateUsersImport)\nflat fields under one hierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    bulkCreateUsersMaxUploadSize -> bulkCreateUsers { maxUploadSize }\n- Mutation: bulkCreateUsersImport        -> bulkCreateUsers { importUsers }\n\nNew holder types BulkCreateUsersQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (BulkCreateUsersResult return type stays a separate file); the\n*Extension classes keep a single bulkCreateUsers accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission\nstays on each leaf. The unit test was repointed to the holder (isValidSiteKey moved with the\nmutation). Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"da18d873079ee3483fa3a204ed1e9228e2536382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/trees/da18d873079ee3483fa3a204ed1e9228e2536382"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/commits/7bc155dc1db9c8511562827a39f899de47eaccbd","verification":{"payload":"tree da18d873079ee3483fa3a204ed1e9228e2536382\nparent 1dc38ebebd1bcdcb89992f8edb0a5c52d4231933\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782026981 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782026981 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a bulkCreateUsers namespace container (#13)\n\nMove the root Query (bulkCreateUsersMaxUploadSize) + root Mutation (bulkCreateUsersImport)\nflat fields under one hierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    bulkCreateUsersMaxUploadSize -> bulkCreateUsers { maxUploadSize }\n- Mutation: bulkCreateUsersImport        -> bulkCreateUsers { importUsers }\n\nNew holder types BulkCreateUsersQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (BulkCreateUsersResult return type stays a separate file); the\n*Extension classes keep a single bulkCreateUsers accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission\nstays on each leaf. The unit test was repointed to the holder (isValidSiteKey moved with the\nmutation). Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-