te-users/commits/72af7be73af0bfb3a46344b120574d3485b9f8c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:47:34Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:47:34Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"docs: document dual-scope authz design and site-admin limitation\n\nThe @GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"adminUsers\") annotation intentionally\ngates at the server permission level so unauthenticated/unpermissioned\nrequests are rejected before the scope-aware isAuthorizedForScope check\nruns.  Add a README section explaining the consequence for site-admins\nand what a future change to lower the gate would entail.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc99b8d4d348e759a1fdf0e99f7eb64394a31a47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/trees/bc99b8d4d348e759a1fdf0e99f7eb64394a31a47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/commits/72af7be73af0bfb3a46344b120574d3485b9f8c3","verification":{"payload":"tree bc99b8d4d348e759a1fdf0e99f7eb64394a31a47\nparent fe2a13412fd441da7c1352d3eb26676d050e5c4d\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750054 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750054 +0200\n\ndocs: document dual-scope authz design and site-admin limitation\n\nThe @GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"adminUsers\") annotation intentionally\ngates at the server permission level so unauthenticated/unpermissioned\nrequests are rejected before the scope-aware isAuthorizedForScope check\nruns.  Add a README section explaining the consequence for site-admins\nand what a future change to lower the gate would entail.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFuYACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3m95wgAmLcyLcnhrzG9i1TnihfWGtMt3SfhU5t9iC43UYRRMf15QU3c/lOu+Kdf\nUIjSSaZ8LiGBN