\nfix(a11y): hide empty result box visually while keeping aria-live DOM node\n\nThe bcu-result status live region container was visible with background\nand padding even when no import result existed. Apply sr-only styling\nwhen importResult is null so the DOM node stays for screen readers\nbut is invisible visually.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoGJuwACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mM9ggA0clAw5abJyx2GnP8VoFQQy/88qlv6SJTGCScUxRqofrWXM1vZ12iUPmT\nzVcj3I/WqRFDCS06QL/b+iSxSLQ89J92pUXBTP3iTx9qvMhDxRvBcRk0S7b1+Kv+\nXvMaKSWUbuhfmwxh6qa5dXXOr1/yJ3jDNkk1uMw1OSSyrP4X9n6wP4DIw4270UNX\nJ4hZvTXM2TiD9TvQgQEa/iqE/qkoqQff5+Z/LPtLsN9T98JVX6fs0+tngMuy8lpF\ncCy1xaYo0FaUoTAMjn5LLxdz/MwENuQv6lPQPenGB7PkI2JIYJZbnRdxXtbalSRi\nLpUK+esnNjg9d+HBF78CLCu3ZGGy1Q==\n=PJEz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-14T20:08:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/bulk-create-users/commit/7462850f00cb9af38