Replace Moonstone file input with hidden input + styled button (#004a80)\n  to bypass unoverridable Moonstone text color that fails AAA contrast\n- Add bcu_fileBtn/bcu_fileInput/bcu_fileName CSS classes\n- Add ''chooseFile'' i18n key\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"59a1ad632ac0d7b2e0697878170bc15554fdf8b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/trees/59a1ad632ac0d7b2e0697878170bc15554fdf8b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/commits/957a1f1bdf438510e016c7ea1761bcd126273f33","verification":{"payload":"tree 59a1ad632ac0d7b2e0697878170bc15554fdf8b7\nparent 57ec71c089368564c9af762f4b6df758d6664d5a\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778787913 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778787913 +0200\n\nfix(a11y): AAA contrast fixes for bulk-create-users\n\n- Darken success alert text color from #256029 to #184f1c (~7.3:1 on #e6f4ea)\n- Replace Moonstone file input with hidden input + styled button (#004a80)\n  to bypass unoverridable Moonstone text color that fails AAA contrast\n- Add bcu_fileBtn/bcu_fileInput/bcu_fileName CSS classes\n- Add ''chooseFile'' i18n key\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoGJkkACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3m2kQf8DBgV9eVejp6/h0JZGwQyLsrT59RfuqQPy9NoTJGyvZbfoDnSf0Bm/M77\nxJP4ho7gCnR1agJdcZ1rMAjWsMXwWy4ggSAGbppvUQMKuxt/pBrs4CPp+RPIXX/w\nEqXxvP96En1Krbrf1gWTzjNCSK60EXQPCt7fhEk5XT7XpExEF8agd3KplDS+Dx5p\n8hxKfPh57s7DCps8EGg7cbFBpaKvDwSLnQLYnH8A5tQVT43zYXBr+2RZ95BsP5Gf\ntVfn9wYcXmD5BKsostlFWzHAQYU153w+CiKbRixjpuX/tWCNvOVAMKW48wGUZYRR\nU0WYdgWZtRD0598tRQst9LMUpf66OA==\n=Vv70\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-14T20:08:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","f