s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/commits/57ec71c089368564c9af762f4b6df758d6664d5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T18:53:59Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T18:53:59Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(accessibility): resolve WCAG 2.1 AA audit issues in bulk-create-users\n\n- CRIT-01: replace dynamic role live region with two fixed-role regions\n  (alert + status) so AT subscriptions remain stable\n- CRIT-02: keep result box container always in DOM, conditionally render\n  content only so live region fires on first population\n- CRIT-03: keep missing-columns error container always in DOM with\n  role=alert and aria-live=assertive; conditionally apply styling\n- MAJ-01: add aria-describedby hint for file input with format/size info\n- MAJ-02: keep requirements box in DOM, use hidden attribute instead of\n  conditional render so aria-controls target is always present\n- MAJ-03: add required attribute to file input\n- MAJ-05: add useEffect to update document.title on mount\n- MAJ-06: wrap Chevron icons in aria-hidden span\n- MAJ-08: remove opacity: 0.7 on .bcu_columnMissing, use #9a1f24\n- MIN-02: increase missing badge font-size from 0.75rem to 0.8125rem\n- MIN-03: localize close button aria-label\n- MIN-04: add aria-busy to form during upload\n- MIN-05: expand ''missing'' badge text to ''missing from CSV''\n- MIN-07: use Typography component=''span'' inside button\n- style: simplify bcu_columnFieldset to keep only border-bottom\n- test: update Cypress selectors for new accessibility structure\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"f897ede5f5800defd10f9b94f7bb05b3f494ff66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/trees/f897ede5f5800defd10f9b94f7bb05b3f494ff66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/commits/57ec71c089368564c9af762f4b6df758d6664d5a","verification":{"payload":"tree f897ede5f5800defd10f9b94f7bb05b3f494ff66\nparent 0912cecdd32df15b084c44a3c31804967a2ea531\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778784839 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778784839 +0200\n\nfix(accessibility): resolve WCAG 2.1 AA audit issues in bulk-create-users\n\n- CRIT-01: replace dynamic role live region with two fixed-role regions\n  (alert + status) so AT subscriptions remain stable\n- CRIT-02: keep result box container always in DOM, conditionally render\n  content only so live region fires on first population\n- CRIT-03: keep missing-columns error container always in DOM with\n  role=alert and aria-live=assertive; conditionally apply styling\n- MAJ-01: add aria-describedby hint for file input with format/size info\n- MAJ-02: keep requirements box in DOM, use hidden attribute instead of\n  conditional render so aria-controls target is always present\n- MAJ-03: add required attribute to file input\n- MAJ-05: add useEffect to update document.title on mount\n- MAJ-06: wrap Chevron icons in aria-hidden span\n- MAJ-08: remove opacity: 0.7 on .bcu_columnMissing, use #9a1f24\n- MIN-02: increase missing badge font-size from 0.75rem to 0.8125rem\n- MIN-03: localize close button aria-label\n- MIN-04: add aria-busy to form during upload\n- MIN-05: expand ''missing'' badge text to ''missing from CSV''\n- MIN-07: use Typography component=''span'' inside button\n- style: simplify bcu_columnFieldset to keep only border-bottom\n- test: update Cypress selectors for new accessibility structure\n\nSigned-off-by: