\n- Use useQuery in the React component; fall back to DEFAULT_MAX_SIZE (10MB)\n  until the query resolves\n- Pass the actual limit in MB to the validation.tooLarge i18n message\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"b211465bfd5c298b411f93cb5752c42a11a46513","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/trees/b211465bfd5c298b411f93cb5752c42a11a46513"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/commits/f55da9d692aff7136ad4facfadc5af2de364866f","verification":{"payload":"tree b211465bfd5c298b411f93cb5752c42a11a46513\nparent 29ebe6811843d32249387cd19365ccc4eb6c43b3\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1777204881 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1777204881 +0200\n\nfeat: retrieve max upload size from SettingsBean instead of hardcoding 10MB\n\n- Add BulkCreateUsersQueryExtension with bulkCreateUsersMaxUploadSize field\n  that delegates to SettingsBean.getInstance().getJahiaFileUploadMaxSize()\n- Add GET_MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE query to CreateUsers.gql.js\n- Use useQuery in the React component; fall back to DEFAULT_MAX_SIZE (10MB)\n  until the query resolves\n- Pass the actual limit in MB to the validation.tooLarge i18n message\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmnt/pEACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lv9wf/ZS+Hx8cLBi9lJWkZ8toYWmfJM9i7u/LNTpjEMoU+xjvW7cfHxC6ro8e0\nkvk/9rAn12ljKF5AocqWTkGxzKClJqfTitODdYuv3DQkaRTtQk8GHQ1zcpwCyepz\ndgZgsbj7ur5dIdYStnoGigR2WgnibS5ByLXezNvKEvMl/BDlH/iXsy6h3Hu56H9Q\ngZbEzzMrNeFv2LRhFLCvYsJ2pkTiXnPy/aDVQJInZHxx418sULqQ8IrjsxVn2x5E\ng+QktDf093QnI+VYWD7tEqRjlT7sLfKlPgDfvODf09Tr7YUpsquNElvvHQYSv3no\nHzew+G/qdTX1CeaOuF3f6cSTol8inw==\n=XRPO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-26T12:20:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/u