ers/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/commits/29ebe6811843d32249387cd19365ccc4eb6c43b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:50:58Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:50:58Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"feat: show groups column in optional columns picker and respect its selection\n\n- Remove the hardcoded `h !== ''groups''` exclusion from both the useEffect\n  filter and the render-time detectedOptional filter, so the groups column\n  appears as a pre-checked optional column when present in the CSV\n- Add `assignGroups` flag in UsersHandler.processUser that is false when\n  allowedColumns is set but does not include \"groups\", so unchecking the\n  groups column skips group assignment entirely\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce566cf7553a9a956256cbbad19861388fb56faa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/trees/ce566cf7553a9a956256cbbad19861388fb56faa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/commits/29ebe6811843d32249387cd19365ccc4eb6c43b3","verification":{"payload":"tree ce566cf7553a9a956256cbbad19861388fb56faa\nparent 45cd2a5d1db1a09d88da8909052d701558b724c6\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1777204258 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1777204258 +0200\n\nfeat: show groups column in optional columns picker and respect its selection\n\n- Remove the hardcoded `h !== ''groups''` exclusion from both the useEffect\n  filter and the render-time detectedOptional filter, so the groups column\n  appears as a pre-checked optional column when present in the CSV\n- Add `assignGroups` flag in UsersHandler.processUser that is false when\n  allowedColumns is set but does not include \"groups\", so unchecking the\n  groups column skips group assignment entirely\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmnt/CIACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lhnggA0Ku4w4TumCDrZi9DwTxBON168MmKCytzDeBVBVEqA1mqTQGEN69NGMgJ\nkBW8WdBvigmuMpKKINhYH5rW8sutlQCFOGL46N6NjYzTZ7t+BmJyrjQqWmcKGK+B\nfjIT6yH/7rniOSJxA5LBEThe8CbMBUI0e9X7g4ZXZT4HDE2KMxI2dqo5+OhxR5/b\nqerQtz7Smp+X46lirF4v6lfoPKNTdy+/NPZI7LF+aeoc1DzEJkCC339fOcUkmjOD\nLY9WF9nI0QH6rN3ri9cjUTOXg03S5PmMor/FMMIW4Zf7KmLIHknlwWzVK+lBpKvZ\nqt3t4O/qCVqzWYGK6QZcUgKT3FdHSQ==\n=Nqmh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-26T12:20:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https: