dollar-sign separator ($) with bracket notation.\nEach group name is now wrapped in square brackets and entries are\ncomma-separated: [group1],[group2],[group3].\n\nUsersHandler: GROUP_PATTERN regex \\[([^\\]]+)\\] extracts group\nnames from the cell; unmatched text is silently ignored so a cell\nwith no brackets produces no group assignments.\n\nUpdated en.json requirements text and removed the hardcoded\n<code>$</code> from createUsers.jsx.\n\nCypress: two new API tests — bracket format with a known group\n(privileged) and graceful skip of a non-existent group.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"79be6000418fa670389f5cb406788cae65220c4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/trees/79be6000418fa670389f5cb406788cae65220c4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/commits/45cd2a5d1db1a09d88da8909052d701558b724c6","verification":{"payload":"tree 79be6000418fa670389f5cb406788cae65220c4b\nparent 1e41dc972724802c799f66098ab4156aa5d06cdc\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1777203958 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1777203958 +0200\n\nChange groups format to bracket notation: [group1],[group2]\n\nReplace the dollar-sign separator ($) with bracket notation.\nEach group name is now wrapped in square brackets and entries are\ncomma-separated: [group1],[group2],[group3].\n\nUsersHandler: GROUP_PATTERN regex \\[([^\\]]+)\\] extracts group\nnames from the cell; unmatched text is silently ignored so a cell\nwith no brackets produces no group assignments.\n\nUpdated en.json requirements text and removed the hardcoded\n<code>$</code> from createUsers.jsx.\n\nCypress: two new API tests — bracket format with a known group\n(privileged) and graceful skip of a non-existent group.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmnt+vYACgkQUhsGUDwS