name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Fix build: replace node-sass with sass, update Node to v22.6.0\n\nnode-sass 6.x uses node-gyp and fails to compile on Node 22.\nDart Sass (sass) is the drop-in replacement.\n\nAlso update frontend-maven-plugin to 1.15.0 and Node to v22.6.0\n(matching report-users-and-groups) to satisfy minimatch@10.x engine\nrequirement introduced by @jahia/webpack-config.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c097804f2777a389eaaadaf2f3c87c487d9a11d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/trees/7c097804f2777a389eaaadaf2f3c87c487d9a11d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/commits/b84f8923818d0544196d5b0f13fff68dcb720312","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c097804f2777a389eaaadaf2f3c87c487d9a11d\nparent 2d5e2b03a64b83701dcc886e3d46e40a26a5a92e\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1777197191 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1777197191 +0200\n\nFix build: replace node-sass with sass, update Node to v22.6.0\n\nnode-sass 6.x uses node-gyp and fails to compile on Node 22.\nDart Sass (sass) is the drop-in replacement.\n\nAlso update frontend-maven-plugin to 1.15.0 and Node to v22.6.0\n(matching report-users-and-groups) to satisfy minimatch@10.x engine\nrequirement introduced by @jahia/webpack-config.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmnt4IcACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3k0kAf+N5BVBmVMQjWA+e1p9SfZhrbrRuL9G9j8HAKRFnIlCgXYxCu4fNxpK5id\n0FglKa4LfDltqTrb6QiPlHsjOzsi7r2RvMREaDERM7Y3nRtkPISSOUT4BDdrgQWF\n/Wr1RUo1FPAkhqijubvfiYMtgeOS6b0zOuMQAzAaWBTapX+tJF49M0gpxbNzqKth\nj6q9oZgII1lLoVTI2BjyGhUUtAclMnE8U3C5JGqgavsGLdR5anyaG74oakiycV5+\np5EK2eb6De4cGz8LhAPAyavUNHYbH1kTjpC2M57VGYo3vd0K+zu4Aivd+VCXQIRn\n2XIB+ScIIQiH0nXGnUBLOKQlF1BgUg==\n=N8m/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-26T12:20:12Z"}},"co