e","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/commits/2d5e2b03a64b83701dcc886e3d46e40a26a5a92e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T09:49:00Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T09:49:00Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Modernize to OSGi DS + GraphQL + React + Cypress (v2)\n\nReplace HTTP servlet with a GraphQL mutation bulkCreateUsersImport that\naccepts CSV content as a plain string. The richer BulkCreateUsersResult\ntype exposes createdCount, skippedCount, errorCount and per-row errors.\n\nJava:\n- Add graphql/ package: BulkCreateUsersGraphQLExtensionsProvider,\n  BulkCreateUsersMutationExtension, BulkCreateUsersResult\n- Rewrite UsersHandler.importUsers() to accept (csvContent, separator,\n  siteKey) and return BulkCreateUsersResult; track per-row counts\n- Delete BulkUsersUploadServlet, CsvFile, disabled Spring XML\n- pom.xml: version 2.0.0-SNAPSHOT, add graphql-dxm-provider dep,\n  remove commons-fileupload, add _dsannotations instruction\n\nFrontend:\n- New CreateUsers.gql.js with BULK_CREATE_USERS_IMPORT mutation\n- Replace fetch() with useMutation from @apollo/client; read file as\n  text via FileReader before sending; show result box with counts\n- Add bcu_ prefix to all CSS classes; add id attributes for Cypress\n- Add i18n keys; add @apollo/client and @jahia/webpack-config deps\n- webpack.config.js uses getModuleFederationConfig; delete webpack.shared.js\n\nTests:\n- tests/ with full Cypress Docker infrastructure (3 test files)\n  01: GraphQL API — import, skip duplicates, invalid CSV\n  02: UI layout — form elements, toggle requirements\n  03: UI import flow — file selection, submit, result box, error\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"2058d2c636e6aee80be5a22ffa9a612ff789cf1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/trees/2058d2c636e6aee80be5a22ffa9a612ff789cf1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/bulk-create-users/git/commits/2d5e2b03a64b83701dcc886e3d46e40a26a5a92e","verification":{"payload":"tree 2058d2c636e6aee80be5a22ffa9a612ff789cf1e\nparent 9cac14f1a82052112958409faba99d8829d471d4\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1777196940 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1777196940 +0200\n\nModernize to OSGi DS + GraphQL + React + Cypress (v2)\n\nReplace HTTP servlet with a GraphQL mutation bulkCreateUsersImport that\naccepts CSV content as a plain string. The richer BulkCreateUsersResult\ntype exposes createdCount, skippedCount, errorCount and per-row errors.\n\nJava:\n- Add graphql/ package: BulkCreateUsersGraphQLExtensionsProvider,\n  BulkCreateUsersMutationExtension, BulkCreateUsersResult\n- Rewrite UsersHandler.importUsers() to accept (csvContent, separator,\n  siteKey) and return BulkCreateUsersResult; track per-row counts\n- Delete BulkUsersUploadServlet, CsvFile, disabled Spring XML\n- pom.xml: version 2.0.0-SNAPSHOT, add graphql-dxm-provider dep,\n  remove commons-fileupload, add _dsannotations instruction\n\nFrontend:\n- New CreateUsers.gql.js with BULK_CREATE_USERS_IMPORT mutation\n- Replace fetch() with useMutation from @apollo/client; read file as\n  text via FileReader before sending; show result box with counts\n- Add bcu_ prefix to all CSS classes; add id attributes for Cypress\n- Add i18n keys; add @apollo/client and @jahia/webpack-config deps\n- webpack.config.js uses getModuleFederationConfig; delete webpack.shared.js\n\nTests:\n- tests/ with full Cypress Docker infrastructure (3 test files)\n  01: GraphQL API — import, skip duplicates, invalid CSV\n  02: UI layout — form elements, toggle requirements\n  03: UI import flow — file selection, submit, result box, error\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmnt34wACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mAGQgAmWzL1BSergUuaP2Ha7D8Q09SoVzi88cvs+/e6ValmWAXmZBlvzgDwUw7\nw32qogbhrJZNM4UmxSrTZ7e9F3bviXU+YrjmUKoWQxS1wTTzu4FrAHlBAYCJmgEU\n32TiUAU1+F2F35xlvtT2HoUS2uLj7B8G/rx9nWazRcYDH9iPMKSoWzrk0wnqVj+J\ndYatuS4Zo4Lz8NTrE65LiTQVrifHasyH39k6Tf88wbMGA+8G5FFG0zYxcMfRjQg1\neVzzgLxTY1wcf3JLVrzthQldPypfBqACohOORa01Uvo6/uSf2vpmEGkGEo7PLsqy\ndL/0p487kcsLh9IsfwtxjM25643E9A==\n=llT0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-26T12:20:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/bulk-create-users/com